plot3d(flow * 100, "Flow Stream", "trail", "#22ccff", "separate", 1)`},{name:"Volume Torus Tunnel",description:'Relative volume as a flowing tunnel of rings — ring size tracks activity ("torus" style)',category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// Volume Torus Tunnel — ring tunnel + raw columns + climax cones
