plot3d(volume, "Raw Volume", "bars3d", "#ffd43b", "separate", 1)`},{name:"OBV Trail Stream",description:'On-Balance Volume as a streaming ribbon whose width breathes with flow ("trail" style)',category:"3D Visualizations",source:`// OBV Trail Stream — flow stream + manifold + trend-cross cones
